---The length between this rolling stocks front and rear joints. Joints are the point where connection\_distance is measured from when rolling stock are connected to one another. Wheels sprite are placed based on the joint position.
---
---Maximum joint distance is 15.
---
---Note: There needs to be border at least 0.2 between the [bounding box](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/EntityPrototype.html%23collision_box#collision_box) edge and joint. This means that the collision\_box must be at least `{{-0,-0.2},{0,0.2}}`.
---
