---
---Maximum speed of the rolling stock in tiles/tick.
---
---In-game, the max speed of a train is `average(all_rolling_stock_max_speeds) × average(all_fuel_modifiers_in_all_locomotives)`. If this value is not provided it is ignored for the average(all\_rolling\_stock\_max\_speed) calculation. This calculated train speed is then silently capped to 7386.3km/h.
